    "result_text": "The build succeeds with all tests passing.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `ownerSegment` derived field on the Owner API response.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added the `ownerSegment` property to the `Owner` schema as a read-only string enum with the four allowed values (`PREMIUM_METRO`, `PREMIUM_REGIONAL`, `STANDARD_METRO`, `STANDARD_REGIONAL`) and a description of the derivation rules.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added an `@Mapping` for `ownerSegment` and the `ownerSegment(Owner)` method:\n   - **TIER** = `PREMIUM` when `membershipLevel(owner)` is 3+, else `STANDARD` (reusing the existing `membershipLevel` derivation).\n   - **AREA** = `METRO` when `locality(owner)` is `NSW`, `VIC`, or `QLD`, else `REGIONAL` (reusing the existing `locality` derivation).\n   - Returns `null` for a null owner, consistent with the other derived-field methods.\n\nThe OpenAPI generator produced the `OwnerDto.OwnerSegmentEnum`, and the two acceptance tests (`STANDARD_METRO` for a known region, `STANDARD_REGIONAL` for an unknown one) pass: **Tests run: 2, Failures: 0, Errors: 0 \u2014 BUILD SUCCESS**.",
